{"id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","title":"Cofinality","display":"df-cofinality — Cofinality","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cofinality","aliases":["58-df-cofinality"],"display":"df-cofinality — Cofinality","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-increasing.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-range.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cofinality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cofinality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cofinality — Cofinality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a725410f88e5842e\" href=\"?note=a725410f88e5842e\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-increasing.md\">../batch12/58-df-increasing.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"44d32dc8fecf5e62\" href=\"?note=44d32dc8fecf5e62\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-range.md\">../batch09/58-df-range.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,f\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Increasing}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Increasing}_S\\)</span> (increasing-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a725410f88e5842e\" href=\"?note=a725410f88e5842e\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-increasing.md\">../batch12/58-df-increasing.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}\\)</span> (range operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"44d32dc8fecf5e62\" href=\"?note=44d32dc8fecf5e62\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-range.md\">../batch09/58-df-range.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span> (cofinality function defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofinality}\\vdash\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to{}&amp;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Increasing}_S(f,\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha),\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\alpha\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\;(\\gamma\\in\\delta\\lor\\gamma=\\delta)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha)\\;\\neg\\exists g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Increasing}_S(g,\\beta,\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\alpha\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\;(\\gamma\\in\\delta\\lor\\gamma=\\delta)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofinality}\\vdash\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to{}&amp;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Increasing}_S(f,\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha),\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\alpha\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\;(\\gamma\\in\\delta\\lor\\gamma=\\delta)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha)\\;\\neg\\exists g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Increasing}_S(g,\\beta,\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\alpha\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\;(\\gamma\\in\\delta\\lor\\gamma=\\delta)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cofinality is the least ordinal length of an increasing cofinal map.  Cofinality in a successor ordinal permits the top element itself, hence the non-strict clause <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\leq\\delta\">\\(\\gamma\\leq\\delta\\)</span> written as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in\\delta\\lor\\gamma=\\delta\">\\(\\gamma\\in\\delta\\lor\\gamma=\\delta\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The removed upstream unboundedness predicate was restricted to infinite cardinals and therefore could not define cofinality for arbitrary ordinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-increasing.md","status":"resolved","id":"a725410f88e5842e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-increasing.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-range.md","status":"resolved","id":"44d32dc8fecf5e62","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-range.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-increasing.md","status":"resolved","id":"a725410f88e5842e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Increasing}_S$ (increasing-map predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-increasing.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-range.md","status":"resolved","id":"44d32dc8fecf5e62","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ran}$ (range operator, see [[../batch09/58-df-range.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Increasing}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofinality}\\vdash\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to{}&\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha))\\\\\n&\\land\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Increasing}_S(f,\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha),\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\alpha\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\;(\\gamma\\in\\delta\\lor\\gamma=\\delta)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha)\\;\\neg\\exists g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Increasing}_S(g,\\beta,\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\alpha\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\;(\\gamma\\in\\delta\\lor\\gamma=\\delta)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\gamma\\leq\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in\\delta\\lor\\gamma=\\delta","display":false}],"bytes":1655,"backlinks":[{"id":"1011326379eaea3c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"18c8c81ab92a8a3c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{cf}$ (cofinality function, see [[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]])"},{"id":"644bb6a06a77da42","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{cf}$ (cofinality function, see [[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]])"},{"id":"dc236cd956